        "final_response": "I fixed the one finding, the high cyclomatic complexity (CCN 12, threshold 10) in `TradeController::execute`. I didn't build or run anything, so the change is unverified until the orchestrator validates it.\n\n**What changed:** `execute` in `trade-service/src/main/java/com/juanesteban/tcc/trade/TradeController.java` now only coordinates the steps. I moved each step into a private helper, keeping the code and order of operations as they were:\n- `validate(req)` does the request validation and returns 400 on bad input.\n- `fetchPrice(symbol)` calls the market service and returns 400 for an unknown symbol.\n- `applyToUser(...)` calls the user service and maps 404 and 400 as before.\n- `publish(...)` sends the RabbitMQ `trade.completed` message and only logs a warning if publishing fails.\n\nThe public API, status codes, service topology and messaging names are unchanged, and no other files were touched.\n\nNothing is left unresolved.",
